<title>ITALY: GROSS YIELD 6.49 PCT ON 3-MONTH ITALIAN T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>GROSS YIELD 6.49 PCT ON 3-MONTH ITALIAN T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 13.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.49	(6.33)    98.39	  (98.43)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.57	(6.53)    96.76	  (96.83)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.50	(6.38)    93.90	  (94.00)</p>
<p>Note: results compare with a previous auction on July 28.</p>
</text>
